# UI8Kit primitives — Twig (PHP)

Primitives live in `ui8kit/ui` (one folder per primitive, generated code: do not edit by hand).
Import them from there: Composer package `generated/twig` (namespace `UI8Kit\Twig`): register `new \UI8Kit\Twig\TwigExtension()` and add `ui8kit/ui/ui` to the loader, then `{% include 'button/Button.html.twig' with { ariaLabel: 'Save', children: html } only %}` (one template per part: `<brick>/<Part>.html.twig`). Props are variables (`tag`, `class`, `ariaLabel`, `htmlFor`), extra attributes go in `attrs` (caller wins). `children` is trusted HTML printed with `|raw` — never pass user input (XSS); render it with Twig first (`{% set html %}…{% endset %}`). There is no asChild: for a custom root use `ui8kit_classes('buttonClasses', { class: 'px-4' })`.

## 1. Use a primitive instead of raw HTML

Where a primitive exists for an element, use the primitive, never the raw tag:

| Primitive | Renders |
| --- | --- |
| `Box` | `<div>`, `<section>`, `<article>`, `<aside>`, `<header>`, `<footer>`, … (via `tag`) |
| `Text` | `<p>`, `<span>`, `<h1>`, `<h2>`, `<h3>`, `<h4>`, … (via `tag`) |
| `Button` | `<a>`, `<button>` |
| `Link` | `<a>` |
| `Label` | `<label>` |
| `Form` | `<form>` |
| `Input` | `<input>` |
| `Textarea` | `<textarea>` |
| `Select` | `<select>` |
| `SelectOption` | `<option>` |
| `SelectOptGroup` | `<optgroup>` |
| `Checkbox` | `<input>` |
| `Radio` | `<input>` |
| `Switch` | `<button>` |
| `Image` | `<img>` |
| `Picture` | `<picture>` |
| `Source` | `<source>` |
| `Icon` | `<span>` |
| `Dialog` | `<dialog>` |
| `Disclosure` | `<details>` |
| `Summary` | `<summary>` |
| `Meter` | `<meter>` |
| `Progress` | `<progress>` |
| `Separator` | `<hr>` |

Raw HTML is fine only for elements no primitive covers.

## 2. `tag` accepts only real HTML5 tags

`Box` and `Text` choose their element with `tag`. Pass only a real HTML5 tag from the allowed list
(never a component name, custom element or made-up tag):

- `Box`: `div`, `section`, `article`, `aside`, `header`, `footer`, `main`, `nav`, `figure`, `search`, `ul`, `ol`, `li`, `dl`, `dt`, `dd`, `fieldset`, `table`, `thead`, `tbody`, `tfoot`, `tr`, `th`, `td`, `caption`, `colgroup`, `col`
- `Text`: `p`, `span`, `h1`, `h2`, `h3`, `h4`, `h5`, `h6`, `blockquote`, `figcaption`, `pre`, `code`, `small`, `strong`, `em`, `time`, `legend`

## 3. Static ARIA via props

Set ARIA through the primitive's typed props (e.g. `aria-label`, `aria-pressed`, `aria-expanded`, `aria-controls`), as static values.
Do not hand-write `role`/`aria-*` that a primitive already renders (`Icon` sets `aria-hidden`
or `role="img"` + `aria-label` from `label`; `Switch` sets `role="switch"`).

## 4. Colors only via shadcn token classes

Style with token utility classes only: `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`,
`text-primary-foreground`, `bg-secondary`, `bg-muted`, `text-muted-foreground`, `bg-accent`,
`bg-destructive`, `border-border`, `border-input`, `ring-ring`, `bg-card`, `bg-popover`, …
No palette colors (`bg-blue-500`), no hex/rgb/hsl values, no arbitrary color classes (`bg-[#fff]`),
no inline `style` colors.

## 5. Spacing: 8 + 4 rule

- Spacing (padding, margin, gap, space-*) uses the 8px step: Tailwind `2, 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 16, …`
  (`p-2` = 8px, `gap-4` = 16px).
- The 4px step (`1`, e.g. `px-1`, `gap-1`) is allowed only inside controls (button, input,
  select, checkbox, badge-like inline control content).
- No half-steps (`p-0.5`, `p-1.5`, `p-2.5`, …), no odd steps (`p-3`, `p-5`, `p-7`), no arbitrary
  px values (`p-[13px]`, `mt-[7px]`).

## 6. Icons: Lucide inside `Icon`

Use Lucide icons (inline Lucide SVG markup (copy the `<svg>` from lucide.dev) passed as `children`) as the child of the `Icon` primitive; size via `Icon` `size`
(`xs`, `sm`, `md`, `lg`, `xl`). Give `label` when the icon carries meaning; omit it for
decorative icons.

```twig
{% set label %}{% include 'text/Text.html.twig' with { tag: 'h2', class: 'text-foreground', children: 'Title' } only %}{% endset %}
{% include 'box/Box.html.twig' with { tag: 'section', class: 'flex flex-col gap-4 p-4 bg-card text-card-foreground', children: label } only %}
<a href="/save" class="{{ ui8kit_classes('buttonClasses', { class: 'px-4' }) }}">Save</a>
```

## Checks

Review-only: verify the rules above when reviewing changes; there is no automated command for them.
